  "description": "Distribute coins in a binary tree such that every node has exactly one coin using minimum moves.",
  "pseudocode": "let moves = 0;\nfunction dfs(node) {\n  if (!node) return 0;\n  let left = dfs(node.left);\n  let right = dfs(node.right);\n  moves += Math.abs(left) + Math.abs(right);\n  return node.val + left + right - 1;\n}",
